<title>USA: PHLX to list options on American Pad.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on American Pad.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Wednesday it would list options on American Pad &amp; Paper Co on October 7.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, and initial expirations of October, November, February and May.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will be the specialist.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
